              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اکسانا (uksānā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin uksānā, \"to draw out (a wick), to excite\", under Sanskrit útkasati, \"opens\" (CDIAL 1718). As a wick is drawn up to make a flame burn higher."
